  "ms": "Application 2\nApplication: 1 mark for likely understanding e.g.\n• 5% x -1.37 (1)\nOR\n• 5 % x 1.37 (1)\nAnswer = - 6.85%\nAward 2 marks for correct answer (accept any in\nthe range of 6.8 to 7 or -6.8 to -7)\n(2)",
